language ESSENCE' 1.0

find a_MOccurrence: matrix indexed by [int(1..2)] of int(0..2)
find b_MOccurrence: matrix indexed by [int(1..2)] of int(0..2)
branching on [a_MOccurrence, b_MOccurrence]
such that
    a_MOccurrence <=lex b_MOccurrence,
    sum([a_MOccurrence[q1] | q1 : int(1..2)]) <= 2,
    sum([b_MOccurrence[q2] | q2 : int(1..2)]) <= 2

